[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reusable model and add the read-only bob capture-parse command with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stable JSON, diagnostics, CLI/docs wiring, and Rust plus ported [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Hammerspoon grammar coverage.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Cursor-aware capture completion endpoint[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]completion[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion: add bob capture-complete as the authoritative cursor-aware [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion service over capture targets, sections, and open tasks, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]returning replacement ranges and stable JSON while preserving the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]current discovery-command contracts.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Signed app foundation and macOS CI[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]foundation[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]foundation: scaffold bobs-org/bob-mac-capture as a macOS 26 SwiftPM app [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with a pure CaptureCore, direct cancellable bob process client, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fixture-backed tests, macOS CI, deterministic bundle/install/sign [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scripts, LSUIElement lifecycle, Carbon hotkey, pre-warmed non-activating[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]NSPanel, draft-safe multi-line editor, settings, and launch-at-login [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]support.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Capture execution and reliable feedback[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]feedback[dim] · [dim][/dim]after foundation[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]feedback: wire submit and explicit clipboard-resolving preview through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob capture, prevent duplicate writes, preserve drafts and destinations [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]on every failure, add inline status, and implement signed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]UNUserNotificationCenter notifications with foreground presentation, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]authorization diagnostics, a test action, and Open Note.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Highlighting, completion, and live preview[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]intelligence[dim] · [dim][/dim]after completion, foundation[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]intelligence: connect macOS 26 attributed editing to capture-parse [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]spans, add an inline keyboard completion popover backed by [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-complete, and add debounced cancellable exact preview through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob capture --dry-run --no-clip with cached targets and explicit [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stale-response handling.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Integrated macOS validation and release hardening[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]hardening[dim] · [dim][/dim]after feedback, intelligence[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]hardening: complete app accessibility, appearance, privacy, error, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]packaging, installation, and user documentation; exercise core and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]full-app CI; and run the owner-assisted signed on-Mac notification, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]focus, clipboard, Spaces, IME, latency, and smoke-test gate without [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]changing the existing Hammerspoon hotkey.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Hammerspoon cutover and migration cleanup[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cutover[dim] · [dim][/dim]after hardenin